    {
      "claim": "Omeprazole is a prodrug that undergoes acid-catalyzed conversion in the acidic secretory canaliculi of gastric parietal cells into a reactive sulfenamide derivative.",
      "verdict": "UNVERIFIABLE",
      "rationale": "No PubMed evidence context was provided to verify this biochemical mechanism."
